# Secrets must not reach an image.
#
# The app reads a `.env` at startup, and although anything already in the environment wins — so a
# stray file could never override what Compose passes in — a key baked into a layer is a key that
# travels with every copy of the image. Keep it out entirely.
.env
.env.*
!.env.sample

# Build output and local state, which only slow the context transfer.
bin/
obj/
*.user
